The output-policy.ts validation is adapted from assert_file_overwrite in
fftools/ffmpeg_opt.c and the AVERROR_EXIT normalization in fftools/ffmpeg.c,
at fixed FFmpeg commit946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8.
The order relative to source/stream initialization follows ffmpeg_mux_init.c.
